By considering the interplay between on-board storage constraints and power allocation strategies, we can design more efficient and reliable satellite communication systems. This includes understanding the typical on-board memory capacities, optimizing power allocation algorithms, considering the impact on latency and throughput, and exploring the potential advancements in emerging technologies.

