* **Dynamic Bandwidth Allocation:**  Can we dynamically allocate bandwidth to different traffic streams based on real-time needs and latency requirements? This would ensure efficient allocation and minimize congestion.
* **Resource-Aware Scheduling:**  How can we implement a scheduling algorithm that prioritizes traffic based on its resource requirements and latency needs?  This could involve dynamic allocation of resources across different links and time slots.

